              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Dawidi abwira Abiyatari ati: “Kuri urya musi, igihe wa Munyedomu Dowegi yari harya, nari nzi ko ategerezwa kubibwira Sawuli. Ni jewe ntumye umuryango wa so wose upfa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
